MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Calendar: Day/Week/Month/Year view switcher (persisted) + year density dots.
Graph: always-visible node labels (three-spritetext, theme-reactive) + connected-
  neighbor glow on hover/select (neighbors brighten neon-red, links particle, rest dim).
Study: own settings dialog — new/review daily caps (0=unlimited), due|random order
  (day-seeded stable shuffle), flip + interval-hint toggles; StudyState.settings +
  migration; buildQueue enforces caps/order; 29 tests pass.
Recorder (Codex): recording survives navigation (module-level service.ts + nanostores
  + global REC pill), deletable recordings (Trash + optional companion note), zoom-
  responsive stacking, full UI/UX pass.
Usage: Settings › Usage panel reading GET /nemesis-llm/usage (endpoint added to the
  proxy in the kit; honest 'not available' until deployed) — plan, used/limit, remaining.
Connections: Settings › Connections — connect Blackboard/Outlook/Gmail/Canvas/custom
  with NO api keys (sign in once in the native browser); connected-status from
  persist:school cookies (school-view connectionStatus/disconnect IPC).
Artifacts: student build now excludes vault + recordings files (keeps Library/Exports
  deliverables) — Artifacts is chat-made things, not a second Library.
Rail: native view placeholder gets a left gutter so the pane resize sash is reachable
  in Browser mode; removed the duplicate Browser button from the Sources header.
Pills (ChatGPT recon): same-site citations cluster into one chip (favicon+badge+N) +
  a stacked-favicon 'Sources' affordance → Sources rail.
Account/settings: the lower-left account button now opens Settings (removed the
  separate gear + account dialog).
